    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Casting Shock to face for 2 damage instead of deploying Hexing Squelcher. Hexing Squelcher can't be countered (safe against the UW opponent's likely countermagic), puts a 2/2 body on board for pressure, and crucially makes all spells uncounterable - enabling Nova Hellkite to land safely next turn through the opponent's No More Lies or other counters.",
